        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Gerotranscendent Generativity: How Older Adults Maintain a Focus on “Being” for Others</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 1582px;\n    background: #eeeeee;\n    color: #3d3d3d;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1582px;\n    height: 945px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .header {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0 0 auto 0;\n    height: 150px;\n    padding: 23px 24px;\n    color: white;\n    background: #e6183c;\n  }\n  .header h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .2px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .byline {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n\n  h2, h3 {\n    color: #cc2944;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 16px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: .1px;\n  }\n  h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    letter-spacing: .1px;\n  }\n  .subhead {\n    margin: 17px 0 14px;\n    color: #cc2944;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 13px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n  }\n  .quote {\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #d22a45;\n  }\n  .bold {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .tiny {\n    font-size: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n\n  .left-column {\n  